      "writtenOn": "2024-08-28T02:32:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You might want to think about what the code should do if a previous download is already happening. I think the download will be queued, but every time the property changes, that will add a new download request to the queue.\n\nAlso you might want to think about what to do if there is no network connectivity when the property changes. At the moment I would assume the task will just fail, but you might want to instead schedule it when there is connectivity.\n\nIn general it seems like this code should use JobScheduler. Maybe you are already planning to do tthat.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 43,
        "startChar": 47,
        "endLine": 43,
        "endChar": 70
      },
      "revId": "1f4ddd0cf7af5c1e76607703923ed89298fe9b9e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
