      "message": "In aosp/3236503 I am adding a [@RequiresApi annotation](https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Connectivity/+/3236503/7/networksecurity/service/src/com/android/server/net/ct/CertificateTransparencyFlagsListener.java). That should take care of the lint error.",
