      "writtenOn": "2024-08-28T09:28:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The case when there is no network connectivity when the property changes should already be handled by the [DownloadManager](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/app/DownloadManager.java;l\u003d1110-1117;drc\u003d2a21dd13be99be7c939b2c45b08656477055c562) that adds the download in pending status and resolves it when connectivity is available.\n\nThe handling of a new download a previous one is already happening/scheduled is missing, yes. I thought I added a TODO as a reminder, but I see it\u0027s not there. I\u0027ll fix that.",
